{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content docs\\\\dev\\\\harness-gap-closure\\\\e01-reliability-aggregation.md -Raw; echo \\\"=====\\\"; Get-Content docs\\\\dev\\\\harness-gap-closure\\\\E01-SHA256SUMS -Raw\"","aggregated_output":"# E01 可靠性聚合与正反样本评测门\n\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：E01（TF-0274）。GPU/网络/付费调用：无。\n\n## 范围\n\n把可靠性口径接进既有的 Agent Dev benefit 报告：`pnpm agent-dev:evaluate`（`scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs`）现在除原有指标外，还输出 `reliability` 段。聚合逻辑在 `scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.mjs`（纯函数、无副作用，runner 与单元测试共用），数据来自预登记 fixture `shared/agent-dev/reliability-fixture.json`。不新建指标平台、不建持久 store、不改产品默认值/产品锁/approval 语义。\n\n## 口径（预登记）\n\n- `k=3`、`minCases>=20`、`flake<=0.01`；安全必测项 `0 skip / 0 flake`。\n- `pass^k` = “全部 k 次 trial 都通过”的**完整** case 比例；`pass@k`（至少一次通过）**单独**给出，二者不混用。\n- 任一 missing/timeout/crash/skip 使该 case 成为 `incomplete`：保留在 `incomplete` 列表、排除出 `pass^k`/`pass@k` 分母，绝不静默删除。\n- `flake` = 首次调度 trial 失败、后续固定重跑成功的完整 case 比例；首次失败保留，重试成功不洗掉原门失败。\n- 正/负锚点：`positive` 必须全通过、`negative` 必须全部拒绝；违反即 `gate=fail`。\n- 完整 case 数低于 `minCases` 时 `gate=insufficient-sample`，不以小样本冒充 PASS。\n\n## 本包结果\n\nfixture 故意小（4 个完整 case + 1 个 incomplete）：`passK=0.25`、`passAtK=0.75`、`perTrialSuccessRate=0.5`、`flakeRate=0.25`、`gate=insufficient-sample`。这是**确定性 oracle**，不是真实模型泛化证据，也不冒充 PASS。\n\n## 边界与不做项\n\n- 不搬真实 provider/真人证据；不宣称统计显著性。\n- 不把 `pass@k` 当 `pass^k`；不用重试抹掉首次失败。\n- 不改产品默认值/锁；不新增定时 automation；不新建第二份进度账本。\r\n=====\r\nb0f0214881444c68e9c7b339a528c80cc9d2894831191cd6ee16ed8825afdb94  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/e01-acceptance.json\n7e91d923dc163923edeca9004371e72d491344fee242839c78aef7d4a852fba6  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/e01-reliability-aggregation.md\n7be6a25141eacf0633d99e3fa7cd8c5b8e3bdf28e96b581d8857fa007cbdb1e0  harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-reliability-aggregation.md\n9286c8b4a0d07368336d1269fe90dd93f5be7712b47fb20bf6e582b6d9249192  harness/specs/rules/reliability-aggregation-boundary.md\n608b281e056bca48a510a81e4e5d884ac838e3fff18b2ca8a6a80b79ddb640b9  scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.mjs\n0450c42fc5232611e7c8c37ebcbd508a39678414692601353092752549084e23  scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.d.mts\nc0240069aaaeec7380bdef61055c2b064274bb95340a7758c08f6b0c21fa54f1  shared/agent-dev/reliability-fixture.json\n92fcf8665516cb9f27af32a86e69875c079928894a18d6e7db427cbc45e70af2  tests/unit/agent-dev-reliability-aggregation.test.ts\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
